  partName: Blade20
  description: The Blade20 is a tiny, thin-flat blade situated at the middle-center-front
    of the jet engine, playing a vital role in air compression and flow direction.
    Constructed from Blades2 material, its small size and thin-flat shape enable
    it to navigate high-velocity air flows while maintaining structural integrity.
    Interestingly, the Blade20's material properties allow for optimal thermal management
    and resistance to fatigue.
